                                "sense_id": "611baf28-cb49-302c-8295-f90b6c708814",
                                "text": "To prevent the strong from oppressing the weak; to protect the acquisitions of industry . . . are duties which require that delegated authority should be exerted by public force and the vindicatory dispensations of pains and penalties."
